<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Smelting H1 net up 6 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Smelting H1 net up 6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		6.92	   vs	 6.53</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     9.20	   vs	 8.70</p>
<p>    Turnover		 10.17	   vs	 9.46</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Malaysia Smelting Corp Bhd. It is involved in smelting of tin concentrates and tin bearing materials.</p>
</text>
